Run `make` after checkout to build the bundled PBC library and run both examples.

Dependencies:

 * flex
 * bison
 * automake
 * libtool
 * autoconf
 * libgmp-dev


On macOS with Homebrew GMP, run:

    CPPFLAGS="-I$(brew --prefix gmp)/include" LDFLAGS="-L$(brew --prefix gmp)/lib" make

The Makefile passes CPPFLAGS, CFLAGS, and LDFLAGS to the compiler.
If configuration fails, fix the dependency paths and run make again.
